<section class="section wrap closing-invite" id="booking"><p class="eyebrow">LET'S TALK</p><h2>YOU'VE WORKED HARD TO BUILD YOUR BUSINESS. <em>LET'S TALK ABOUT WHAT YOU WANT IT TO MAKE POSSIBLE.</em></h2><div class="story-copy"><p>Maybe you've got a financial question that's been on your mind for months. Maybe there's an opportunity you haven't had time to explore. Or maybe you'd just like another perspective from someone who understands business ownership.</p><p>Whatever brought you here, I'd enjoy hearing about it.</p><p><strong>We don't need to solve everything in 20 minutes. We just need to find out whether I can bring something valuable to the table.</strong></p></div><a class="button primary section-cta" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="final">Book a 20-Minute Call With Adam →</a><p class="fine">Free Zoom conversation · No obligation</p><div class="secondary-path"><h3>NOT READY TO TALK YET? THAT'S OKAY.</h3><p>Start with nine questions designed to help you think about your business, your money, and the life you're building.</p><a href="#quiz" data-quiz-link data-placement="final">Take the Free 3-Minute Quiz →</a></div></section>
